x is 0.0
print of f"I boundary-flags-small-equality 0 {converged of x} {stable of x} {improving of x} {oscillating of x} {diverging of x} {equilibrium of x} {report of x} {where is x} {num_type of x} {why is x} null {how is x} {when is x} {(atan2 of [(where is x), -1.0]) < 0.0} false"
x is 1e-05
print of f"I boundary-flags-small-equality 1 {converged of x} {stable of x} {improving of x} {oscillating of x} {diverging of x} {equilibrium of x} {report of x} {where is x} {num_type of x} {why is x} {num_type of (why is x)} {how is x} {when is x} false false"
print of "DONE boundary-flags-small-equality"
